cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SDR Scanner in academic work, cite this repository."
title: "SDR Scanner"
abstract: >-
  Desktop SDR application for Pluto+, HackRF One, IQ recordings and a
  simulator, with spectrum and waterfall analysis, software VFO, demodulation,
  full-range band scanning, JSON background comparison, passive drone-band
  monitoring, IQ evidence clips and a local signal-signature library.
authors:
  - name: "SDR Scanner contributors"
type: software
license: GPL-3.0-only
version: 0.25.0
date-released: "2026-11-05"
keywords:
  - SDR
  - ADALM-PLUTO
  - Pluto+
  - HackRF
  - spectrum
  - drone detection
  - RF
